message: "If you use MatplotlibMasterPro in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MatplotlibMasterPro: a research-grade Matplotlib toolkit and notebook curriculum"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/MatplotlibMasterPro"
