keywords:
  - matplotlib
  - data visualization
  - publication-quality figures
  - reproducible research
  - colour-blind accessibility
  - jupyter notebooks
abstract: >-
  MatplotlibMasterPro pairs a 23-notebook Matplotlib curriculum with an
  installable Python package (mplmasterpro) providing journal-specific figure
  sizing, metadata-aware export, bootstrap confidence bands, raincloud plots,
  colour-vision-deficiency simulation and quantitative palette checks. Every
  notebook, script and dataset is executed or regenerated in continuous
  integration so the published figures are reproducible.
